<title>USA: Intermedia Comms gets New Jersey approval.</title>
<headline>Intermedia Comms gets New Jersey approval.</headline>
<dateline>TAMPA, Fla. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Intermedia Communications Inc said on Thursday it had been approved to offer local phone service in New Jersey, bringing to 15 the number of states the Florida-based company covers.</p>
<p>Intermedia offers a package of local, long distance, Internet and data services. In March it reached an interconnection agreement with Bell Atlantic Corp which allows it to reach many eastern seaboard states. ((-- New York Newsrom 212 859 1610))</p>
</text>
